rule:
ONLY the index (the 50 TotalSegmentator label names mapped to search terms, the microscopy class
names mapped to search terms and to related tests). Every sentence shown is quoted unchanged from the local open
library (StatPearls CC BY-NC-ND 4.0, NCBI Bookshelf open-access books, OpenStax; licence per quote), filed mechanically:
  - "mri": names the structure and MRI / magnetic resonance / T1 / T2 / signal;
  - "findings": names the structure and a finding word (lesion, mass, tear, oedema, enhancement, abnormal ...);
  - "differential": names the structure and differential / distinguish / mimic / versus;
  - "identify" (microscopy): names the cell or tissue and a microscopy word (stain, nucleus, granule, cytoplasm, lobe ...).
Internet Archive books are excluded. Numbers are as printed; nothing is written or summarised by a model.
